.net/f2dbc78a/uploads/origins/338c2997-e30e-4058-8bed-4e2bb710cbef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5068d52b326ac326e096470cf9b3aec4 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I'm always looking at Mamei's illustrations.\n\nThank you for your response to my marshmallow the other day. Once again, my name is 43.\n\nI'd like to ask for an illustration from you, so I've made a request. I'm sorry if there are any problems with the price or settings.\n\nI'd like you to draw Melt Lillith from Fate/GrandOrder (FGO).\n\nMelt Lillith has two outfits, a regular one (5 stars) and a swimsuit one (4 stars), and there are six outfits in total. I love all of Melt Lillith's outfits, so I hope you don't mind.\n\nI can only post one URL, so I'll post it here. I'm sorry if it's incomplete.\n\nPermanent star 5 https://kamigame.jp/fgo/攻略データベース/サーヴァント一覧/霊基/アルターエゴ/メルトリリス.html\n\nSwimsuit Star 4 https://kamigame.jp/fgo/攻略データベース/サーヴァント一覧/霊基/ランサー/メルトリリス(Swimsuit).html\n\nI'm sure you're busy at the moment with your manuscript, so I hope you'll be able to get on with it when you can. I'm sure you'll be happy with the results.\n\nIf there is anything else that needs to be filled in, I apologize. If so, please let me know.\n\nI look forward to working with you on the above project.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@usamimi/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ebb2f1a/uploads/origins/852815ed-7c3a-4e0d-8385-c16e16030d98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bf850eaa6215b1a48e3b3742e363a05e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9ebb2f1a/uploads/origins/852815ed-7c3a-4e0d-8385-c16e16030d98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30