&s=fec7da0f4ebc8e22fd2d327e46843d53", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/98cb631f/uploads/origins/a242a155-92d9-4b28-9759-6a89f976be45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fec7da0f4ebc8e22fd2d327e46843d53, https://si.imgix.net/98cb631f/uploads/origins/a242a155-92d9-4b28-9759-6a89f976be45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=47358ab13ffeacbca5454dfcf7e62318 2x, https://si.imgix.net/98cb631f/uploads/origins/a242a155-92d9-4b28-9759-6a89f976be45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=917f5f84fe6b16d4060551cdce09251f 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your work is very cute! I like what you did for some of the FFXIV characters in your gallery, so I would like to request my FFXIV OC as well! \n\nShe is an elegant and charismatic お姉さん type. She likes to hide her emotions behind a smile but she also has a bit of an 男前 side. She likes to tease the people she cares about.\n\nShe is an adventurer who is talented with magic. Her hobbies are alchemy, cooking and gardening. She likes to either spend time in her garden, brewing magic potions in her atelier, or cooking or baking sweets in her kitchen for her loved ones.\n\nShe has a cute, fluffy and white pet sheep! If possible I'd like if it could be in the picture somewhere.\n\nSome useful aesthetics for her are: \"moon\", \"blue butterflies\", \"orchids\", \"peonies\" but you do not need to use them.\n\nPlease draw whatever you'd like! You do not need to choose any of her outfits in the ref either and can dress her up yourself if you'd like! 全部お任せます!\n\nよろしくお願いいたします!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2qxomzne905", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@usamimi/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 238828, "client_id": 41993, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https:/