She's just an ordinary JK from everywhere, Max-chan!\n\nShe gets a magic stick by chance, and when she picks it up and casts a spell, she transforms into ......! I'm not sure if it's a good thing or not.\n\nIt's time to take on the bad guys who are causing all this trouble! A special kill! Usamimical Beam!\n\n\nPlease take care of them like this.\n\nReference material\nhttps://skeb.jp/@mugihata/works/2\nhttps://skeb.jp/@muto_095/works/2\nhttps://skeb.jp/@StrawberryPlut/works/7", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@usamimi/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/601f93aa/uploads/origins/22e546c6-d0c3-4114-8eb2-cbf3857f49eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=afe865cc1216c74444cf33217209cdc2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/601f93aa/uploads/origins/22e546c6-d0c3-4114-8eb2-cbf3857f49eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=afe865cc1216c74444cf33217209cdc2, https://si.imgix.net/601f93aa/uploads/origins/22e546c6-d0c3-4114-8eb2-cbf3857f49eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=35b496f2f72bc51594b8ef863dbb7da1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/601f93aa/uploads/origins/22e546c6-d0c3-4114-8eb2-cbf3857f49eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=16cb586c382f671a6635039d53eee255 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 238828, "client_id": 615890, "nc": 32}, {"path": "/@usamimi/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, 