ply cares for other people. When it comes to romance, he gets embarrassed very easily. Otherwise he is laid-back and can be intimidating.\n\nAlric is a little more mature. He's very energetic and straightforward about things and how he feels. Sometimes he will do things without thinking about them.\n\nPlease draw them in casual clothing of your own design! Also, please do not draw Rho'bin with his glasses. Everything else about the art is up to you. Thank you!\n\nRho'bin: http://imgur.com/gallery/kcX1G99\n\nAlric: http://imgur.com/gallery/EdQsbcW", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@usamimi/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 238828, "client_id": 1322355, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/95c06316/uploads/origins/a824561d-bf51-44de-b649-233855fd08b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=029aff2c75d74721482766494b49badb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/95c06316/uploads/origins/a824561d-bf51-44de-b649-233855fd08b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=029aff2c75d74721482766494b49badb, https://si.imgix.net/95c06316/uploads/origins/a824561d-bf51-44de-b649-233855fd08b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67538099b462854d70d6c471f3110748 2x, https://si.imgix.net/95c06316/uploads/origins/a824561d-bf51-44de-b649-233855fd08b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f77fb70baa0ade40cae121209601ab90 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/95c06316/uploads/origins/a824561d-bf51-44de-b649-233855fd08b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c6ad55099d762f5ba37f247498268fa9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/95c06316/uploads/origins/